<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Resumo Semanal de Negócios</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f6f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#f4f6f8;padding:24px 0;">
    <tr><td align="center">
      <table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;padding:32px;">
        <tr><td style="font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;color:#166534;padding-bottom:16px;">Agri-Fi</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:18px;font-weight:bold;padding-bottom:12px;">Resumo Semanal de Negócios</td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:14px;line-height:22px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Olá {{farmerName}}, este é o desempenho dos seus negócios ativos durante {{weekRange}}:</p><p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;">Novos investidores esta semana: <strong>{{newInvestorCount}}</strong> (${{newInvestorTotal}} investido)</p><h3 style="font-size:15px;margin:20px 0 8px 0;">{{sectionDeals}}</h3>{{{dealsHtml}}}<h3 style="font-size:15px;margin:20px 0 8px 0;">{{sectionMilestones}}</h3>{{{milestonesHtml}}}<h3 style="font-size:15px;margin:20px 0 8px 0;">{{sectionDocuments}}</h3>{{{documentsHtml}}}<h3 style="font-size:15px;margin:20px 0 8px 0;">{{sectionActions}}</h3>{{{actionsHtml}}}<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;"><a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color:#6b7280;">{{unsubscribeLabel}}</a></p>
        </td></tr>
        <tr><td style="font-size:12px;color:#6b7280;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">
          Agri-Fi &middot; Secure agricultural trade financing
        </td></tr>
      </table>
    </td></tr>
  </table>
